{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21806","headline":"有鸟二十章 二十 · 元稹","name":"有鸟二十章 二十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟真白鹤，飞上九霄云漠漠。\n司晨守夜悲鸡犬，啄腐吞腥笑鵰鹗。\n尧年值雪度关山，晋室闻琴下寥廓。\n辽东尽尔千岁人，怅望桥边旧城郭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21806.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21806","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}